{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2021-10-04 07:00:00', 'title': 'CENTENE EXPANDS MEDICARE ADVANTAGE OFFERINGS FOR 2022', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, OCT. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT PLANS TO EXPAND ITS MEDICARE ADVANTAGE OFFERINGS, OFFERING ITS WIDE RANGE OF MEDICARE ADVANTAGE PLANS IN 1,575 COUNTIES ACROSS 36 STATES DURING THE 2022 MEDICARE ANNUAL ENROLLMENT PERIOD (AEP). "AT A TIME WHEN MANY SENIORS AND THEIR FAMILIES ARE STILL GRAPPLING WITH THE EFFECTS OF THE PANDEMIC, WE ARE COMMITTED TO EXPANDING CHOICE AND ACCESS TO HIGH-QUALITY, AFFORDABLE MEDICARE PLANS DURING THIS YEAR\'S ANNUAL ENROLLMENT PERIOD," SAID BRENT LAYTON, CENTENE\'S PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER.'}